{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>ESC (Electronics Security Company)</strong> is a hacking game that challenges players to step into the shoes of an &quot;ethical&quot; hacker. As an infiltrator, you are entrusted with hacking into various computer systems to accomplish  objectives and unveil hidden secrets. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/ESC_2.gif?t=1743767663\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">you must strategically navigate through a diverse range of scenarios, each presenting unique challenges and objectives. Embark on a variety of missions as you infiltrate systems to unravel hidden secrets and retrieve classified information.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/ESC_1.gif?t=1743767663\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The objectives you must achieve can vary greatly, including bypassing security systems and retrieving sensitive data.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/extras/ESC_3.gif?t=1743767663\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge your skills, intuition, and wit as you navigate through a world shrouded in secrecy, where the power of hacking lies in the palm of your hand.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2811590?t=1743767663","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2811590?t=1743767663","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743767663","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2811590/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743767663","categori